@SnapshotTesting_HostAddress = http://localhost:5142

### 1. Get All Invoices
GET {{SnapshotTesting_HostAddress}}/api/invoices
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get Seeded Invoice By Id
GET {{SnapshotTesting_HostAddress}}/api/invoices/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Invoice Summary
GET {{SnapshotTesting_HostAddress}}/api/invoices/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/summary
Accept: application/json

### 4. Create New Invoice
POST {{SnapshotTesting_HostAddress}}/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": {
